{"ticker":"MO","updated":"2026-10-23T23:18:26Z","profile":{"longName":"Altria Group, Inc.","shortName":"Altria Group, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Defensive","industry":"Tobacco","country":"United States","website":"https://www.altria.com","fullTimeEmployees":5900,"marketCap":124078661632,"trailingPE":15.64421,"forwardPE":12.671956,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":6.0691967,"pegRatio":2.83,"targetMeanPrice":70.0,"targetHighPrice":82.0,"targetLowPrice":58.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":11,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":0.012,"earningsGrowth":-0.027,"grossMargins":0.72359,"operatingMargins":0.61706,"profitMargins":0.38999,"totalRevenue":20444000256,"beta":0.461,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":77.06,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":54.7,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":5.84},"summary":"Altria Group, Inc., through its subsidiaries, manufactures and sells smokeable and oral tobacco products in the United States. It offers cigarettes primarily under the Marlboro brand; large cigars and pipe tobacco under the Black & Mild brand; moist smokeless tobacco and oral tobacco products under the Copenhagen, Skoal, Red Seal, and Husky brands; oral nicotine pouches under the on! brand; and e-vapor products under the NJOY ACE brand. The company sells its products to distributors, as well as large retail organizations, such as chain stores. Altria Group, Inc. was founded in 1822 and is headquartered in Richmond, Virginia.","summary_zh":"奧馳亞集團透過其子公司在美國生產和銷售吸煙和口腔煙草產品。它主要提供萬寶路品牌的捲菸； Black & Mild 品牌的大雪茄和鬥煙； Copenhagen、Skoal、Red Seal 和 Husky 品牌的濕潤無菸菸草和口腔菸草產品；尼古丁口服袋下就上！品牌;以及NJOY ACE品牌下的電子煙產品。該公司將其產品銷售給分銷商以及大型零售組織，例如連鎖店。奧馳亞集團 (Altria Group, Inc.) 成立於 1822 年，總部位於維吉尼亞州里士滿。","sector_zh":"消費者防禦","industry_zh":"菸草","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":67.5,"h":67.71,"l":66.97,"c":67.05,"v":5706800},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":67.02,"h":67.02,"l":66.23,"c":66.45,"v":8535600},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":66.46,"h":66.64,"l":66.11,"c":66.41,"v":4973500},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":66.37,"h":66.51,"l":65.62,"c