take","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNY2JTZEJiU1pSQ1ZMeDZybUpwa0RlY3RYWVVFLUd5a0dOd3k4WjEwc1lRY25GcnRINDhqci03SWdZR0lmMlVLbHJCWXBiaWZmV3B3OXVvdGdlazhVc0s4YnRGU0tpT1Z6TG5NOE9NcG5GaUZHWnJtYnRoR1ZKN1liTDJQZjhtem1TQmtyUUpjdk9qMjZIcVhzTXo4TFZKd2VnRG40cXZ2d0d4Z0JGYktJNVVfZ3pTd1Z6TFAxYmtCeURuZw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"奧馳亞集團 (Altria Group, Inc.) $MO 股票：道明沃特豪斯加拿大公司 (TD Waterhouse Canada Inc.) 增持股份"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":6},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1},{"name":"股票回購/股利","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-25","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/764180/000076418026000017/mo-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"When used in this Annual Report on Form 10-K (\"Form 10-K\"), the terms \"Altria,\" \"we,\" \"us\" and \"our\" refer to either (i) Altria Group, Inc. and its consolidated subsidiaries or (ii) Altria Group, Inc. only and not its consolidated subsidiaries, as appropriate in the context.","zh":"在表格 10-K 年度報告（「表格 10-K」）中使用時，術語「奧馳亞」、「我們」和「我們的」是指 (i) Altria Group, Inc. 及其合併子公司，或 (ii) 僅奧馳亞集團，Inc. 而不是其合併子公司（視上下文而定）。"},{"en":"We have a leading portfolio of tobacco products for U.S. tobacco consumers age 21+. We are Moving Beyond SmokingTM, by responsibly transitioning adult smokers to a smoke-free future, competing vigorously for existing smoke-free adult nicotine consumers and exploring new growth opportunities - beyond the United States and beyond nicotine (\"Vision\").","zh":"我們為 21 歲以上的美國菸草消費者提供領先的菸草產品組合。我們正在「超越吸菸」（Moving Beyond SmokingTM），以負責任的方式幫助成年吸菸者走向無菸的未來，積極爭奪現有的無菸成人尼古丁消費者，並探索新的成長機會——超越美國和尼古丁（「願景」）。"},{"en":"Our wholly owned subsidiaries include Philip Morris USA Inc. (\"PM USA\"), which is engaged in the manufacture and sale of cigarettes; John Middleton Co. (\"Middleton\"), which is engaged in the manufacture and sale of machine-made large cigars and is a wholly owned subsidiary of PM USA; UST LLC (\"UST\"), which, through its wholly owned subsidiary U.S. Smokeless Tobacco Company LLC (\"USSTC\"), is engaged in the manufacture and sale of moist smokeless tobacco (\"MST\") products; Helix Innovations LLC (\"Helix\") and its foreign affiliates (\"Helix International\"), which are engaged in the manufacture and sale of oral nicotine pouches; and NJOY, LLC (\"NJOY\"), which is engaged in the manufacture and sale of e-vapor products. We operate primarily within the United States and generate substantially all of our revenue from domestic customers. Other wholly owned subsidiaries include Altria Group Distribut","zh":"我們的全資子公司包括從事捲菸製造和銷售的菲利普莫里斯美國公司（“PM USA”）； John Middleton Co.（“米德爾頓”），從事機制大雪茄的製造和銷售，是 PM USA 的全資子公司； UST LLC（“UST”）通過其全資子公司美國無菸煙草公司有限責任公司（“UUSSTC”）從事無菸產品（MST Innovations” LLC（「Helix」）及其外國附屬公司（「Helix International」），從事尼古丁口服袋的製造和銷售； NJOY, LLC（「NJOY」）從事電子煙產品的製造和銷售。我們主要在美國境內運營，大部分收入來自國內客戶。其他全資子公司包括奧馳亞集團分銷"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Cigarettes: PM USA is the largest cigarette company in the United States and substantially all cigarettes are manufactured and sold to customers in the United States. Marlboro, the principal cigarette brand of PM USA, has been the largest-selling cigarette brand in the United States for over 50 years. Total smokeable products segment's cigarettes shipment volume in the United States was 61.8 billion units in 2025, a decrease of 10.0% from 2024.","zh":"捲菸：PM USA 是美國最大的捲菸公司，幾乎所有捲菸都是在美國生產和銷售給客戶的。萬寶路是 PM USA 的主要捲菸品牌，50 多年來一直是美國銷售最大的捲菸品牌。 2025年，美國可吸產品細分市場的捲菸總出貨量為618億支，較2024年下降10.0%。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Smokeable Products","val":20485000000,"zh":"吸煙產品部門"},{"name":"Oral Tobacco","val":2802000000,"zh":"口腔煙草細分市場"},{"name":"All Other Segments","val":5000000,"zh":"所有其他部門"}],"total":23279000000}},"peers":["PM","JNJ","PG","VZ","MRK"]}}